,"fullName":"Rep. Norcross, Donald [D-NJ-1]","party":"D","state":"NJ"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-08-29","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Peter J. McGuire Labor Day Landmark Act</strong></p><p>This bill designates the Peter J. McGuire Memorial and Peter J. McGuire Gravesite in Pennsauken, New Jersey, as the Peter J. McGuire Memorial National Commemorative Site.</p><p>The Department of the Interior may enter into cooperative agreements to provide the public with educational and interpretive facilities and programs concerning the commemorative site. Interior may also&nbsp;provide technical and financial assistance to any entity with which it has&nbsp;entered into such cooperative agreement.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-07T13:02:59Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Peter J. McGuire Labor Day Landmark Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-04-07T13:03:04Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-04-07T13:03:04Z"}
